WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:03.811
So just everything is going wrong for Donald
Trump.

00:00:03.811 --> 00:00:05.709
I think you're going to like this one.

00:00:05.709 --> 00:00:10.490
We talked yesterday about the great developments
in terms of the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:15.420
The vaccine being developed by Pfizer was
announced yesterday to have a 90 percent effectiveness

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:20.650
in a large clinical trial, has not yet been
peer reviewed, but it looks very good.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:25.519
Donald Trump immediately tried to attach his
name to it immediately, tweeting in all caps,

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:30.839
stock market up, big vaccine coming soon report
90 percent effective.

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:32.189
Such great news.

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:35.670
Vice President Mike Pence also weighed in
and he just straight up tried to take credit

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:36.670
for it.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.250
He tweeted, huge news.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:44.390
Thanks to the public private partnership forged
by Trump, Pfizer announced its coronavirus

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:50.660
vaccine trial is effective, preventing infection
in 90 percent of its volunteers.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.540
This is all made up.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:57.990
And in fact, it's such nonsense that Pfizer's
head of vaccine research immediately clarified.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.880
We took no money from Trump's so called operation
warp speed.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:06.340
Katherine Janssen, head of vaccine research
at Pfizer, told The New York Times, We have

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:09.050
never taken any money from the U.S. government.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:13.990
She also told The New York Times that Pfizer
was never part of Operation Warp Speed.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:20.060
It's actually hilarious that Trump and Pence
are trying to crowbar their way into this.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:26.600
And as reported by Bloomberg, quote, Among
the front runners, theirs is the only vaccine

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:32.990
project that did not take funding from the
White House led Operation Warp Speed program.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:39.170
To bolster research, development or manufacturing,
you, like almost start to feel just the tiniest

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:46.450
bit sorry for these people, but we actually
don't because they keep insisting they won.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.440
But but Biden did fraud and all this different
stuff.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.920
No, that's not true.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.090
OK, but now they say we got we got the vaccine
done because we gave Pfizer money.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:59.000
Well, no, Pfizer didn't take any money from
you.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.990
OK, well, something something.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.430
And they get nothing.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:07.990
There's actually even more hilarity to this,
which is that this is really a German vaccine.

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:14.730
Work on this vaccine started in Germany in
January because the CEO of Biogen Tech, which

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:20.610
is the partner company with Pfizer that developed
the vaccine, the CEO of Biogen Tech, read

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:25.760
about the virus in the Lancet and realized
this is going to be huge.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.220
So they immediately started working on the
vaccine.

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:32.660
Meanwhile, Trump in January was saying, oh,
we've got this completely under control.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.060
It's one person from China.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.060
It's going to be fine.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:41.600
Trump saying, and was it March 15 cases or
maybe even April 15 cases will soon be zero.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:47.300
That's why this vaccine is now almost ready,
because in Germany, when Trump was doing nothing,

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.760
they started working on it.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:54.300
Donald Trump and Mike Pence are trying to
take credit for a vaccine, but it was actually

00:02:54.300 --> 00:03:00.709
a vaccine developed in Germany by a German
company founded by Turkish immigrants produced

00:03:00.709 --> 00:03:06.220
in the US by a company that took no money
from Donald Trump's operation.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.320
Warp speed.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.780
That's the truth.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.260
Don't let the door hit you on the way out.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.710
Guys will have continued coverage of the vaccine.

